  instructions: "Use a qualified FEA MCP and solver on this exact handle geometry and reviewed basis. Retain mesh, load/support/material definitions, solver inputs and stress/displacement fields, reactions and convergence evidence. Do not use a generic block or synthetic field as handle analysis."
  settings: {"authoring_template":"mcp-task","mcp_server":"import:draft-e4f0ce6f14f1c0347530","mcp_task_tools":["run_simulation"],"max_tool_calls":8,"timeout_seconds":600,"output_format":"json","save_output":true,"output_filename":"results/{{wright.run_id}}/analysis/{{wright.producer_attempt}}/analysis-summary.json","file_policy":"indexed","run_path_template":"wright.run-path/2","revision_policy":"create_new_files","expected_files":"results/{{wright.run_id}}/analysis/{{wright.producer_attempt}}/response-fields.vtu\nresults/{{wright.run_id}}/analysis/{{wright.producer_attempt}}/analysis-basis.json","expected_file_ports":{"analysis_field":"results/{{wright.run_id}}/analysis/{{wright.producer_attempt}}/response-fields.vtu","analysis_basis":"results/{{wright.run_id}}/analysis/{{wright.producer_attempt}}/analysis-basis.json"},"task_guidance":"Use the selected OASiS run_simulation tool with solver skfem. Its qualified environment includes Gmsh, meshio and scikit-fem. The selected workspace is mounted at /workspace inside the provider; resolve the exact upstream STEP and declared output paths under that mount, never another workspace. Use the reviewed specification for material properties, units, load, support regions, allowable response and convergence criteria. If those required decisions or the upstream geometry verification are absent, report blocked rather than inventing an acceptance basis. Retain coarse/fine meshes, solver inputs, boundary selections, reaction/equilibrium checks, stress and displacement arrays and convergence evidence with hashes in analysis-basis.json; write the final exact mesh and response fields to response-fields.vtu. Preserve all attempts and do not overwrite prior results. Keep critic_approved false unless the exact analysis has received the actual independent critic approval; specification review alone is not that approval. Tool success does not establish strength acceptance: the downstream independent check owns that conclusion."}
