  instructions: "Use qualified deterministic checks to compare the final mesh with the reviewed geometry and assess whether the analysis basis covers the selected print orientation. Retain exact before/after identities and measurements. Do not release the package on stale strength evidence. A material, geometry, load-path or orientation change outside the approved basis requires fresh applicable analysis and required reviews. Stop with an actionable reason if the correction/revalidation route is unavailable; never replace a failed or missing check with an AI claim."
  settings: {"qualification_status":"validation_profile_and_revalidation_binding_required"}
  tool: null
  reusable_step: null
end

